Upgrade dovecot from 2.3 to 2.4, which also moves the base image to alpine 3.22. **This is a breaking change for anyone using a dovecot override**: 2.4 does not accept the 2.3 configuration syntax, so `overrides/dovecot/dovecot.conf` and `overrides/nginx/dovecot/proxy.conf` have to be rewritten before upgrading or the imap and front containers will not start. The FAQ entry [My Dovecot override stopped working after upgrading](https://mailu.io/master/faq.html#my-dovecot-override-stopped-working-after-upgrading) describes how to convert them.
